<mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1480" pageHeight="1420" math="0" shadow="0">
  <root>
    <mxCell id="0" />
    <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />

    <mxCell id="title" value="Pathgate v2 — ECS Fargate (ecs-cli, no load balancer)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a1d1f;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="240" y="16" width="1000" height="36" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="subtitle" value="No ALB: nginx task gets a public IP directly. Cloud Map replaces Docker's embedded DNS." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#5b6167;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="280" y="50" width="920" height="24" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="client" value="Browser" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalAlign=top;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=none;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=https://icons.diagrams.net/icon-cache1/Basic-2519/browser-809.svg;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a1d1f;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="710" y="100" width="60" height="60" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="trace" value="&lt;b&gt;Trace: GET /app1/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11.5px&quot;&gt;1. Browser → nginx task's OWN&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;public IP :80 (NO load balancer,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;NO stable DNS name)&lt;br&gt;2. nginx location /app1/ strips prefix&lt;br&gt;3. proxy_pass → Cloud Map name&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;frontend1.pathgate.local:3000&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Cloud Map resolves to that task's&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;current IP (updated automatically&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;as tasks come and go)&lt;br&gt;5. frontend1 task's own nginx serves&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;index.html&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d4b106;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=13;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="1020" y="90" width="360" height="270" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="vpc" value="&lt;b&gt;AWS VPC&lt;/b&gt; — public subnet, one Fargate task per service (no ALB/NLB anywhere)" style="rounded=1;dashed=1;arcSize=4;strokeColor=#8a8f96;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=16;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="60" y="230" width="1360" height="1020" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="nginx" value="&lt;b&gt;nginx task&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-family:monospace;color:#0a4a42&quot;&gt;ecs-cli project: pathgate-nginx&lt;br&gt;image: pathgate-ecscli-nginx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#0a4a42&quot;&gt;assign_public_ip: ENABLED&lt;br&gt;talks to frontends only&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;host/public :80 → container :80&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f6e63;strokeColor=#0a4a42;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;shadow=0;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="580" y="320" width="320" height="150" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="fe1" value="&lt;img src='https://icons.diagrams.net/assets/carbon-icons/1/Logo_React.svg' width='20' height='20'/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;frontend1 task&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;font-family:monospace;color:#1f4e79&quot;&gt;Cloud Map: frontend1.pathgate.local&lt;br&gt;image: ...-frontend-insert&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#3f7fbf&quot;&gt;INSERT ONLY · own nginx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;container port 3000&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf4ff;strokeColor=#3f7fbf;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="140" y="560" width="320" height="200" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="fe2" value="&lt;img src='https://icons.diagrams.net/assets/carbon-icons/1/Logo_React.svg' width='20' height='20'/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;frontend2 task&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;font-family:monospace;color:#1f4e79&quot;&gt;Cloud Map: frontend2.pathgate.local&lt;br&gt;image: ...-frontend-list&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#3f7fbf&quot;&gt;LIST ONLY · own nginx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;container port 3000&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf4ff;strokeColor=#3f7fbf;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="1020" y="560" width="320" height="200" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="backend" value="&lt;b&gt;backend task&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;font-family:monospace;color:#8a3a0f&quot;&gt;Cloud Map: backend.pathgate.local&lt;br&gt;sg: SG_BACKEND (inbound from&lt;br&gt;SG_FRONTEND only)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#b3541e&quot;&gt;routes mounted under /api&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;container port 8000&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fdeee0;strokeColor=#b3541e;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="580" y="800" width="320" height="180" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="db" value="&lt;b&gt;db task&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;font-family:monospace;color:#4a3572&quot;&gt;Cloud Map: db.pathgate.local&lt;br&gt;sg: SG_DB (inbound from SG_BACKEND only)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL 16&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#6b4fa0&quot;&gt;ephemeral storage — no EFS wired up&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;container port 5432&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#efe9fb;strokeColor=#6b4fa0;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="580" y="1030" width="320" height="180" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e1" value="① :80 (task public IP, no LB)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1a1d1f;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="client" target="nginx">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e2" value="② /app1 → frontend1.pathgate.local:3000" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f6e63;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;exitX=0.15;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nginx" target="fe1">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
        <mxPoint x="0" y="-30" as="offset" />
      </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e3" value="② /app2 → frontend2.pathgate.local:3000" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f6e63;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;exitX=0.85;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nginx" target="fe2">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
        <mxPoint x="0" y="-30" as="offset" />
      </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e4a" value="③ /api → backend.pathgate.local:8000" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b3541e;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=block;exitX=0.7;exitY=1;entryX=0.15;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="fe1" target="backend">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e4b" value="③ /api → backend.pathgate.local:8000" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b3541e;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=block;exitX=0.3;exitY=1;entryX=0.85;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="fe2" target="backend">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e5" value="④ SQL → db.pathgate.local:5432" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6b4fa0;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="backend" target="db">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="legend" value="Configuration notes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f6f5f1;strokeColor=#d8d5cd;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=18;spacingTop=14;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="60" y="1270" width="1360" height="150" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend1" value="1. No load balancer anywhere: nginx's task gets a public IP directly (ecs-params.yml: assign_public_ip=ENABLED). That IP changes if the task is ever replaced." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1310" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend2" value="2. Cloud Map (pathgate.local private DNS namespace) replaces Docker's embedded DNS -- each service_discovery block in ecs-params.yml registers one name." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1334" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend3" value="3. Same tiering as v1, enforced twice: nginx's config only names frontend1/frontend2, AND security groups have no rule letting it reach backend or db." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1358" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend4" value="4. Deployed with ecs-cli compose service up (AWS ECS CLI) -- not Terraform, not Docker's docker context create ecs (which forces an ALB)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1382" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

  </root>
</mxGraphModel>
